# Packages to build, one per line, blank lines and # comments ignored.
# The name is the OpenWrt package name, i.e. what `make package/<name>/compile`
# takes and what `opkg install <name>` will take on the device.
#
# Adding a line here and pushing is the whole process for adding a package.
# If it comes from a feed that is not already in feeds.conf, add that too.

